@startuml
' Figure 8.8 - State Machine Diagram: Evidence Lifecycle
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor white

state "Under Analysis" as UA

[*] --> Collected

Collected --> Submitted   : submit [Lead]
Collected --> Transferred : transfer
Submitted --> UA          : analyse\n[needs custody log]
Submitted --> Transferred : transfer
UA        --> Transferred : transfer
Transferred --> UA        : resume
UA        --> Archived    : archive\n[needs Intact verdict]

Collected   --> Flagged : integrity failure
Submitted   --> Flagged : integrity failure
UA          --> Flagged : integrity failure
Transferred --> Flagged : integrity failure
Archived    --> Flagged : integrity failure

Flagged --> UA : resolved [Admin]
Archived --> [*]
@enduml
